WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:05.040
From the paragraph toolbar, you can also
insert further types of content,

cue-2
00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:09.020
such as tables, images, and YouTube
videos.

cue-3
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:12.560
To insert a table, click Insert Table.

cue-4
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:18.480
This creates an empty table with a
two-by-two default size.

cue-5
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:24.860
Clicking any cell of the table brings up a
three vertical dots menu button in that

cue-6
00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:25.120
cell.

cue-7
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.260
Click the button to bring up the table
editing menu.

cue-8
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:36.520
From the table menu, you can add and
delete rows and columns, format a table,

cue-9
00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:38.800
delete the table, and so on.

cue-10
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.280
But you cannot copy-paste tables from
other resources. 

cue-11
00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:52.940
For accessibility, remember to use the
toggle header option for any row or column

cue-12
00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.180
headers in your table

cue-13
00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.840
so that they can be read correctly by a
screen reader.

cue-14
00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.740
If your table needs a caption, you can
enter one by clicking Caption (Optional)

cue-15
00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:09.640
below your table.

cue-16
00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:18.920
To insert an image, in the paragraph
toolbar, click Insert Image.

cue-17
00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:22.440
An image placeholder will appear.

cue-18
00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:29.180
Click the Choose Image button to select,
upload, or indicate the image you want to

cue-19
00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:29.860
insert.

cue-20
00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:42.320
If you select the wrong image or want to
change the image later, click Select Image

cue-21
00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:46.380
in the image toolbar to return to the
Select Image overlay.

cue-22
00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:50.980
You can only add images from the image
upload menu.

cue-23
00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.320
To upload other types of media,

cue-24
00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:56.560
go to the audio or video upload menus.

cue-25
00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:06.040
Click Settings in the image toolbar to
bring up the image setting overlays.

cue-26
00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:11.440
Here, you can optionally adjust the size
of your image.

cue-27
00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:17.060
You can also enter alternative text for
your image.

cue-28
00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:21.980
For accessibility, remember to add a
meaningful image description in the

cue-29
00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:25.880
alternative text for all non-purely
decorative images.

cue-30
00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:34.040
As with tables, if your image needs a
caption, you can enter one by clicking

cue-31
00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.080
Caption (Optional) below your image.

cue-32
00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:42.960
To insert other kinds of content, click
the

cue-33
00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:49.420
plus insert icon in the paragraph toolbar
and select the kind of content you want to

cue-34
00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:53.200
insert. For example, to insert a YouTube
video,

cue-35
00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:58.500
click YouTube and enter the video's URL in
the overlay.
